# ARGUS — Deep Research Agent
# Configuration

# When no external API keys are set, ARGUS falls back to
# free/public APIs (DuckDuckGo, arXiv, HN Algolia) for search
# and uses a heuristic approach for report synthesis.

# Optional: OpenAI / Anthropic API key for LLM-powered
# sub-question planning and report writing.
# ARGUS_LLM_API_KEY=
# ARGUS_LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# ARGUS_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# When set to "1", ARGUS uses mock data (no network calls).
# Useful for testing or demos.
# ARGUS_SIMULATED=1